{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: Agent基础概念MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"如何设计一个生产级的 Agent 状态机？请描述核心状态和状态转换\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent基础概念\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/基础概念\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">在生产环境中，如何设计一个健壮的 Agent 状态机（State Machine）？请描述核心状态定义、状态转换规则、事件驱动机制，以及为什么用状态机而非纯 LLM 链式调用。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1. 答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>为什么用状态机？</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>可枚举所有合法状态转换</strong>，便于调试和异常处理</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>比纯 LLM 链式调用更可控</strong>，每个状态有明确的进入/退出条件</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>支持异步执行和并行工具调用</strong>，提升系统吞吐量</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>易于监控和追踪</strong>，每个状态转换都可记录和审计</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>核心状态设计：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> enum <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Enum<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> auto\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> dataclasses <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> dataclass\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> typing <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Optional<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Any\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">AgentState</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>Enum<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"Agent 核心状态定义\"\"\"</span>\n    INIT <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"init\"</span>                    <span class=\"token comment\"># 初始状态</span>\n    INTENT_PARSED <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"intent_parsed\"</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 意图已解析</span>\n    PLANNED <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"planned\"</span>              <span class=\"token comment\"># 计划已生成</span>\n    EXECUTING <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"executing\"</span>          <span class=\"token comment\"># 执行中</span>\n    TOOL_CALLED <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_called\"</span>      <span class=\"token comment\"># 工具已调用</span>\n    SYNTHESIZING <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"synthesizing\"</span>   <span class=\"token comment\"># 结果整合中</span>\n    COMPLETED <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"completed\"</span>          <span class=\"token comment\"># 已完成</span>\n    FAILED <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"failed\"</span>                <span class=\"token comment\"># 执行失败</span>\n    WAITING_HUMAN <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"waiting_human\"</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 等待人工确认</span>\n    PAUSED <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"paused\"</span>                <span class=\"token comment\"># 已暂停</span>\n\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@dataclass</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">StateTransition</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"状态转换定义\"\"\"</span>\n    from_state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> AgentState\n    to_state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> AgentState\n    event<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>                       <span class=\"token comment\"># 触发事件</span>\n    condition<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Optional<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 转换条件</span>\n    action<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Optional<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>     <span class=\"token comment\"># 转换时执行的动作</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>状态转换规则：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">AgentStateMachine</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"Agent 状态机核心实现\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 定义所有合法的状态转换</span>\n    TRANSITIONS <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 正常流程</span>\n        StateTransition<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>INIT<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> INTENT_PARSED<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"intent_parsed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        StateTransition<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>INTENT_PARSED<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> PLANNED<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"plan_created\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        StateTransition<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>PLANNED<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> EXECUTING<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"execution_started\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        StateTransition<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>EXECUTING<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> TOOL_CALLED<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_invoked\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        StateTransition<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>TOOL_CALLED<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> SYNTHESIZING<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"all_tools_done\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        StateTransition<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>TOOL_CALLED<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> EXECUTING<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"more_steps_needed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        StateTransition<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>SYNTHESIZING<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> COMPLETED<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"response_ready\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 异常流程</span>\n        StateTransition<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>EXECUTING<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> FAILED<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"max_retries_exceeded\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        StateTransition<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>EXECUTING<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> WAITING_HUMAN<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"human_approval_needed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        StateTransition<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>WAITING_HUMAN<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> EXECUTING<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"human_approved\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        StateTransition<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>WAITING_HUMAN<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> FAILED<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"human_rejected\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        StateTransition<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>EXECUTING<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> PAUSED<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"pause_requested\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        StateTransition<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>PAUSED<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> EXECUTING<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"resume_requested\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        StateTransition<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>FAILED<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> INIT<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"retry_requested\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>state <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> AgentState<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>INIT\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>history <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">can_transition</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> event<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"检查当前状态下是否可以处理该事件\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> trans <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>TRANSITIONS<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> trans<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>from_state <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>state <span class=\"token keyword\">and</span> trans<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>event <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> event<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">transition</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> event<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> event_data<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> AgentState<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"执行状态转换\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>can_transition<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>event<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">raise</span> InvalidTransitionError<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"无法从 </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> 通过事件 '</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>event<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">' 转换\"</span></span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> trans <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>TRANSITIONS<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> trans<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>from_state <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>state <span class=\"token keyword\">and</span> trans<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>event <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> event<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                old_state <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>state\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>state <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> trans<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>to_state\n                \n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 记录转换历史</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>history<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"from\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> old_state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"to\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> trans<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>to_state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"event\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> event<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"timestamp\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"data\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> event_data\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                \n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 执行转换动作</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> trans<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>execute_action<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>trans<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> event_data<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                \n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>state\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">execute_action</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> action<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> data<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"执行状态转换时的动作\"\"\"</span>\n        action_map <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"log_transition\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_log<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"notify_user\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_notify<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"cleanup_resources\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_cleanup<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> action <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> action_map<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            action_map<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>事件驱动的 Agent 编排器：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> asyncio\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> typing <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Callable\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">EventDrivenOrchestrator</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"事件驱动的 Agent 编排器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>state_machine <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> AgentStateMachine<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>event_handlers<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>Callable<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_registry <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ToolRegistry<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">on</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> event<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> handler<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Callable<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"注册事件处理器\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> event <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>event_handlers<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>event_handlers<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>event<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>event_handlers<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>event<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>handler<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">emit</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> event<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> data<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"触发事件\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 状态转换</span>\n        new_state <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>state_machine<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>transition<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>event<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> data<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"状态转换: → </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>new_state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 执行事件处理器</span>\n        handlers <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>event_handlers<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>event<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> handler <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> handlers<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> handler<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>state_machine<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"完整执行流程\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># INIT → INTENT_PARSED</span>\n            intent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>parse_intent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>emit<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"intent_parsed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"intent\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intent<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># INTENT_PARSED → PLANNED</span>\n            plan <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>create_plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>intent<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>emit<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"plan_created\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"plan\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># PLANNED → EXECUTING</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>emit<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"execution_started\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 执行循环</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> step <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>execute_step<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>step<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                \n                <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>needs_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    <span class=\"token comment\"># EXECUTING → TOOL_CALLED → EXECUTING</span>\n                    <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>emit<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"tool_invoked\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"tool\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                    observation <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>call_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                    <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>emit<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"tool_result\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"observation\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                \n                <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>needs_human<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    <span class=\"token comment\"># EXECUTING → WAITING_HUMAN</span>\n                    <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>emit<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"human_approval_needed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 等待人工介入</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># TOOL_CALLED → SYNTHESIZING → COMPLETED</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>emit<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"all_tools_done\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>synthesize_response<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>emit<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"response_ready\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"response\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> MaxRetryExceeded<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>emit<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"max_retries_exceeded\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"error\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>emit<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"execution_failed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"error\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>设计决策的考量：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计选择</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>为什么用状态机？</td>\n<td>可枚举合法转换，便于 debug 和异常处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>为什么用事件驱动？</td>\n<td>解耦组件，支持异步和并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>为什么用 DAG 而非线性队列？</td>\n<td>支持并行子任务（如同时查数据库和调 API）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>为什么保留 WAITING_HUMAN？</td>\n<td>关键操作（转账、删除）需要人工确认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">2. 延伸追问</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：如何处理状态机中的并发问题？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：①使用事件队列串行处理 ②状态转换加乐观锁 ③每个会话独立状态机实例</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：状态机如何保证可恢复性（容灾）？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：①每个状态转换持久化到数据库 ②支持从任意状态恢复 ③定期快照 + 事件溯源</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">3. 常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：状态机限制了 Agent 的灵活性</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：状态机定义的是\"框架约束\"，每个状态内部的决策仍由 LLM 完成，灵活性与可控性兼得</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"4. 相关\" dir=\"auto\">4. 相关</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a> — 返回主题导航</li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}